{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 0, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“嘿～这边的超市好便宜种类也很齐全呢……”", "text_idx": 208, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 21, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 286, "voice": "_sn4665", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 1, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“从纱凪住的地方很少过来这里买东西吧。”", "text_idx": 196, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 276, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 2, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“如果只有我一个人是还好。”", "text_idx": 213, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 286, "voice": "_sn4666", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 3, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“因为理央也想自己选零食，所以只能去家里附近的……”", "text_idx": 209, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 26, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 286, "voice": "_sn4667", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 4, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "今天是星期日，客人也比平日多。", "text_idx": 255, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 5, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "──可以告诉我新吾家附近的超市吗？", "text_idx": 245, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 6, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "昨晚她在电话中问我，所以我今天去纱凪家接她，带她来了。", "text_idx": 277, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 27, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 7, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "不过先打电话过去的人是我。", "text_idx": 252, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 8, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "……我偷偷甩了甩头，想法学姐的模样和表情甩开。", "text_idx": 244, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 23, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 9, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "不知道是对谁的罪恶感还残留在心中……", "text_idx": 251, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 10, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "不过昨晚在电话中听到纱凪的声音，还有今天直接见面都让我轻松了不少。", "text_idx": 253, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 33, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 11, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“啊……买这个零食好了。理央一定会喜欢！”", "text_idx": 203, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 21, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 286, "voice": "_sn4668", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 12, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“机会难得，多买一点吧？我会帮忙提袋子。”", "text_idx": 228, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 21, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 276, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 13, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“……感觉好奇怪。”", "text_idx": 184, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 286, "voice": "_sn4669", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 14, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“欸？”", "text_idx": 230, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 4, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 276, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 15, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“因为跟理央买东西的时候，一直都是我提东西……”", "text_idx": 211, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 24, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 286, "voice": "_sn4670", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 16, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“该不会，现在这样很像夫妻？”", "text_idx": 236, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 286, "voice": "_sn4671", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 17, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“我也在想相同的事。”", "text_idx": 220, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 276, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 18, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "环顾四周，带着小孩的年轻夫妻也不少。", "text_idx": 283, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 19, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "只是至今为止都没有特别意识到而已。", "text_idx": 258, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 20, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "看着他们，觉得……真好。", "text_idx": 284, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 21, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "不由自主就产生了这种感觉。", "text_idx": 250, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 22, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“对了，买点东西带去给上午轮班的人吧。”", "text_idx": 215, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 286, "voice": "_sn4672", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 23, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“也对，那今天就这样穿便服去社团吧。”", "text_idx": 193, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 276, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 24, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“…………”", "text_idx": 183, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 286, "voice": "_sn4673", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 25, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我一提议，身旁的纱凪就停下脚步。", "text_idx": 268, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 26, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“怎么了？”", "text_idx": 217, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 276, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 27, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“啊，嗯，果然……穿成这种男人的打扮很那个吧……”", "text_idx": 204, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 25, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 286, "voice": "_sn4674", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 28, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“新吾也觉得要一起逛街的话，还是女孩子打扮比较好对吧？”", "text_idx": 226, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 28, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 286, "voice": "_sn4675", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 29, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“…………”", "text_idx": 183, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 276, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 30, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我面对纱凪，拉起她的手。", "text_idx": 274, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 31, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“欸、那个……我的话还没……”", "text_idx": 229, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 286, "voice": "_sn4676", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 32, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“只要是跟纱凪一起，什么打扮都无所谓。”", "text_idx": 200, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 276, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 33, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“！？”", "text_idx": 243, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 4, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 286, "voice": "_sn4677", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 34, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“而且要是纱凪穿女孩子的打扮，经过的男人都会回头看你的。”", "text_idx": 233, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 29, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 276, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 35, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“……这样你会忌妒？”", "text_idx": 188, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 286, "voice": "_sn4678", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 36, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“与其说忌妒……”", "text_idx": 192, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 276, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 37, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我还没说完自己就笑了。", "text_idx": 272, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 38, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“真的是很会拐我的，纱凪。”", "text_idx": 232, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 276, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 39, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "当然会忌妒了。", "text_idx": 266, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 7, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 40, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "因为我绝对不想把她让给任何人。", "text_idx": 261, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 41, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“……抱歉喔。我又在纠结多余的事情……”", "text_idx": 186, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 286, "voice": "_sn4679", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 42, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“因为跟新吾交往的事，我没能告诉美羽学姐和班上的同学……”", "text_idx": 210, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 29, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 286, "voice": "_sn4680", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 43, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“那种事我不在意喔。”", "text_idx": 242, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 276, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 44, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“但是……”", "text_idx": 197, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 286, "voice": "_sn4681", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 45, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“从交往开始我就决定了。”", "text_idx": 195, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 276, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 46, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“我要跟纱凪一起前进。慢慢的也可以，两个人一起改变吧。”", "text_idx": 223, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 28, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 276, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 47, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“…………”", "text_idx": 183, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 286, "voice": "_sn4682", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 48, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“所以不需要着急。我们有很多时间，而且……”", "text_idx": 224, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 22, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 276, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 49, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“我会一直在纱凪身边。”", "text_idx": 221, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 276, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 50, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“今后也会像这样站在纱凪身旁，帮你提购物篮。”", "text_idx": 194, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 23, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 276, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 51, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“新吾……”", "text_idx": 225, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 286, "voice": "_sn4683", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 52, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我自己也说得有点害羞。", "text_idx": 271, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 53, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "凝视了彼此一会，路过的老夫妻看到我们这样笑了笑。", "text_idx": 257, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 24, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 54, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "这时我们才回过神来。", "text_idx": 293, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 55, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“我、我们应该要考虑一下说话的场合。”", "text_idx": 219, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 286, "voice": "_sn4684", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 56, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“说的也是，继续买东西吧。”", "text_idx": 237, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 276, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 57, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“嗯♪”", "text_idx": 206, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 4, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 286, "voice": "_sn4685", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 58, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "纱凪回握我的手。", "text_idx": 287, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 59, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "她一开始大幅度地甩着我们牵着的手。", "text_idx": 264, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 60, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "然后随即意识到这会影响到别人，于是改成小小地摆动。", "text_idx": 281, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 25, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 61, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "场所和服装都无所谓。", "text_idx": 263, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 62, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "只要跟这女孩在一起，我随时随地都会露出笑容。", "text_idx": 259, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 22, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 63, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“袋子我提一半吧？”", "text_idx": 234, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 286, "voice": "_sn4686", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 64, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“没关系，都是零食很轻的。”", "text_idx": 231, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 276, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 65, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“不是那个问题。两个人分一半，感觉很棒不是吗？”", "text_idx": 190, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 24, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 286, "voice": "_sn4687", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 66, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "纱凪笑着说，把我手上的袋子抢走。", "text_idx": 288, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 67, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“对了，明天会合的场所还没决定呢。”", "text_idx": 216, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 286, "voice": "_sn4688", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 68, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“你这么一说我才想起来。”", "text_idx": 199, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 276, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 69, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“那个，不然……晚上７点在这里！”", "text_idx": 240, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 286, "voice": "_sn4689", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 70, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“在这里会合？”", "text_idx": 212, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 276, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 71, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“嗯，而且这里离新吾的家也很近。”", "text_idx": 207, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 286, "voice": "_sn4690", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 72, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“但是反正有社团活动，一起回去不行吗？”", "text_idx": 198, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 276, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 73, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“不行。因为我也有很多事情要准备。”", "text_idx": 191, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 286, "voice": "_sn4691", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 74, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "那些“很多”她没打算告诉我。", "text_idx": 294, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 75, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“那明天晚上７点在这里会合……这样没问题吧？”", "text_idx": 241, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 23, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 276, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 76, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“要是敢让我等１分钟我就立刻回去喔。”", "text_idx": 235, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 286, "voice": "_sn4692", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 77, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“我知道。”", "text_idx": 222, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 276, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 78, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "根据至今为止的经验，跟纱凪约碰面还是提早到比较好。", "text_idx": 278, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 25, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 79, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "因为纱凪一定会比约好的时间更早在那里等我……", "text_idx": 262, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 22, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 80, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "然后，今天社团结束后的回家路上。", "text_idx": 282, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 81, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "跟昨天一样，我看到了打工的美羽学姐。", "text_idx": 291, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 82, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“啊，新吾君辛苦了～”", "text_idx": 205, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 290, "voice": "_mu3340", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 83, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“……辛苦了。”", "text_idx": 187, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 276, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 84, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "一如往常的笑容。", "text_idx": 248, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 85, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "但是我笑不出来。", "text_idx": 256, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 86, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "今天一早学姐就在社团教室工作了。", "text_idx": 254, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 87, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "她是个就算我和纱凪阻止也不会停止的人。", "text_idx": 265, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 88, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“那个！”", "text_idx": 239, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 5, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 276, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 89, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“呵呵，天色很晚了新吾君也快点回家比较好喔。”", "text_idx": 201, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 23, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 290, "voice": "_mu3341", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 90, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“…………”", "text_idx": 183, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 276, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 91, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "──请不要勉强自己。", "text_idx": 246, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 92, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我连这样一句话都说不出口。", "text_idx": 273, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 93, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "因为我知道她会怎么回答了。", "text_idx": 260, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 94, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "没事的。然后笑得跟平常一样。", "text_idx": 279, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 95, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“怎么了？啊，新吾君也要卫生纸吗～？”", "text_idx": 218, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 290, "voice": "_mu3342", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 96, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“……我，抱歉。”", "text_idx": 185, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 276, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 97, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“……？”", "text_idx": 189, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 5, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 290, "voice": "_mu3343", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 98, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“新吾君没有做什么需要对我道歉的事情喔？”", "text_idx": 227, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 21, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 290, "voice": "_mu3344", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 99, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "不是那个意思。", "text_idx": 249, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 7, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 100, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我，什么都没做。", "text_idx": 275, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 101, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "跟纱凪交往后，我一直专注在她身上。", "text_idx": 292, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 102, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "感觉学姐的背影比以前更遥远了。", "text_idx": 267, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 103, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我到底是为了什么才加入社团的？", "text_idx": 270, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 104, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“唔呼呼，明明是假日辛苦了。太晚回去小樱乃会担心的喔。”", "text_idx": 202, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 28, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 290, "voice": "_mu3345", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 105, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“学姐也……请不要勉强自己……”", "text_idx": 214, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 276, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 106, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "终于挤出这句话了。", "text_idx": 289, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 107, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "然后收到了预料之中的笑容。", "text_idx": 280, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 108, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“谢谢你，不过没事的♪”", "text_idx": 238, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 290, "voice": "_mu3346", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 109, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我再也说不出其他的话。", "text_idx": 269, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
